    "yellow/solid_leggings.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 35,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-14 19:13",
   "text": "Noted — the garment type itself is the problem, not the execution.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 36,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-14 19:14",
   "text": "Next in the cart: Different garment types, everything else matched. I'd leave the first one.",
   "images": [
    "purple/solid_sweater.jpg",
